1
00:00:06,074 --> 00:00:08,889
Today is the day. No retreat, no surrender, Zino?

2
00:00:08,939 --> 00:00:11,052
Once a goal goes in, no refund!

3
00:00:13,752 --> 00:00:16,591
My 100 francs has ambition. Big ambition.

4
00:00:16,641 --> 00:00:20,114
Six of us have put in. The winning team takes 600,

5
00:00:20,164 --> 00:00:23,775
200 for each man. Three goals. My blood is hot.

6
00:00:26,275 --> 00:00:27,174
Talk all you want, Zino.

7
00:00:27,224 --> 00:00:28,988
Today your knee will kiss the gravel.

8
00:00:29,088 --> 00:00:32,428
Hey! It's only a game. No need for war.

9
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:40,323
Pass it! There's space at the back post!

10
00:00:40,423 --> 00:00:42,625
Zino, the back post is open!

11
00:00:45,125 --> 00:00:46,517
I've got him covered. Go in!

12
00:00:51,979 --> 00:00:53,080
They can't catch me!

13
00:01:01,504 --> 00:01:03,529
Sorry, Ayuk. Get up.

14
00:01:06,629 --> 00:01:08,344
ONE-nil!

15
00:01:08,444 --> 00:01:10,099
Arey one, Zino zero!

16
00:01:10,149 --> 00:01:12,835
Zino, your bottle is crying!

17
00:01:16,747 --> 00:01:18,921
Ayuk, one touch! Robi, cover!

18
00:01:25,897 --> 00:01:27,322
Wait! Where did the pass go?!

19
00:01:27,422 --> 00:01:28,560
Chai!

20
00:01:38,184 --> 00:01:39,527
Did you come to play ball

21
00:01:39,577 --> 00:01:41,083
or to scrape my skin?!

22
00:01:41,133 --> 00:01:43,152
That was the gravel testing you, not me!

23
00:01:50,127 --> 00:01:53,156
GOAL! Equalizer!

24
00:01:55,656 --> 00:01:58,301
One-one!

25
00:01:58,401 --> 00:01:59,501
That's it!

26
00:02:09,487 --> 00:02:10,594
Two-two!

27
00:02:10,644 --> 00:02:14,417
Next goal takes the 600!

28
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:24,385
GOAL! THREE! The bottle rang like a church bell!

29
00:02:24,435 --> 00:02:25,597
Bring the 600!

30
00:02:28,589 --> 00:02:30,113
What goal?! It didn't touch!

31
00:02:30,163 --> 00:02:33,217
A foot pushed the bottle. That one doesn't count!

32
00:02:33,621 --> 00:02:35,294
That's a clean goal.

33
00:02:35,394 --> 00:02:37,422
It's only 200 francs. No need to fight!

34
00:02:39,722 --> 00:02:40,959
Get out of the way, Pastor!

35
00:02:44,059 --> 00:02:45,932
When a man passes you, you carry his bag.

36
00:02:45,982 --> 00:02:47,082
What is this?

37
00:02:52,214 --> 00:02:53,640
It's old man style.

38
00:02:53,690 --> 00:02:56,553
Your own force comes back to you.

39
00:03:02,053 --> 00:03:05,506
Kung fu will finish you all!

40
00:03:08,006 --> 00:03:09,978
You're all blowing wind, not fire.

41
00:03:19,002 --> 00:03:21,797
Bruce Lee meets Grandpa on Fiango road!

42
00:03:34,789 --> 00:03:35,589
ENOUGH!

43
00:03:35,459 --> 00:03:39,592
You're fighting over 600 francs on the road?

44
00:03:39,642 --> 00:03:41,113
I saw the match,

45
00:03:41,163 --> 00:03:44,242
and little bro Zino's team won.

46
00:03:44,292 --> 00:03:46,226
Grand Nestor, the ball didn't touch the bottle!

47
00:03:47,254 --> 00:03:48,896
Don't worry. Next match.

48
00:03:50,286 --> 00:03:52,251
Take your money. And Arey, football is not a fight.

49
00:03:52,301 --> 00:03:53,549
Go and clean your mouth.

50
00:03:58,649 --> 00:04:00,541
Yes, Grand Nestor.

51
00:04:08,603 --> 00:04:11,333
Thank you, Grand. Two hundred for Ayuk,

52
00:04:11,383 --> 00:04:14,605
two hundred for Robi, two hundred for me.

53
00:04:17,667 --> 00:04:20,219
Chai! A champion with a bloody knee!
